    "lawCode": "",
    "lawSection": "",
    "memo": " BILL NUMBER:  S3650\n\n TITLE OF BILL :\nAn act to legalize, validate, ratify and confirm certain\ntransportation contracts of the Eden central school district\n\n\n PURPOSE :\nRelates to the transportation contracts for Hamburg central School\nDistrict.\n\n SUMMARY OF PROVISIONS :\nThis bill rectifies submission errors made by Eden central School\ndistrict when filing transportation agreements from the 2007-08 school\nyear.\n\n JUSTIFICATION :\nThe Eden Central School District made an error in submitting\ntransportation contracts for the 2007-2008 school year, and as a\nresult, the State Department of Education did not approve them. In\norder for Eden Central to receive the correct amount of state\ntransportation aid these past contract numbers must now be validated\nthrough special legislation. Failure to receive reimbursement of the\ntransportation contract costs would create undue fiscal hardship to\nthe school district and its students.\n\n LEGISLATIVE HISTORY :\nThis is new legislation.\n\n FISCAL IMPLICATIONS :\nNone to the state.\n\n EFFECTIVE DATE :\nThis act shall take effect immediately.\n",
